# dist/ is the frontend build output embedded into the binary (see webui.go).
# A real build must never be committed, but the placeholder index.html must be,
# otherwise a fresh clone (no pnpm/node) fails to compile. The root .gitignore
# ignores every dist/ directory, so re-include this one and then keep ignoring
# its contents except the placeholder. Scoped here on purpose: the release
# ignore/copy pattern belongs to PB-95, not this package.
!/dist/
/dist/*
!/dist/index.html
